1.define inside playbook  [higher priority]
  -hosts:webservergrp
   vars:
    http_port: 80
    sqluser: admin
  ### to call this use "{{sqluser}}"

2.inventory based [create these file on inventory level]
  group_var/all         >> 3rd priority
  group_vars/groupname  >> 2nd priority
  host_vars/hostname    >>high priority after playbook var

3.can define in roles [include var from files in playbook]

4.variables generated from setup modules
  ansible_os_family
  ansible_processor_cores
  ansible_kernal
  ansible_architecture

5.command line var [ansible-playbook -e sqluser=admin variable.yaml] 'first priorty than everything'
